| ttf-r81-422 | bromine-blowout-tower | MODIFY | **incorrect (wrong-modify / selector-wrong-leg)** | designed | −0.68 | live HS 16.8 t/h > 11.0 cap; 0.90 t/h cut spent on currently-losing LS |
